-<p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.7);max-width:560px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:2rem;font-size:.95rem">The Myrtle Beach mistakes that cost buyers the most: flood zones, HOA rules, condo litigation, and Airbnb math, each checked for you before you make an offer.</p><div style="background:rgba(244,239,232,.06);border:1px solid rgba(244,239,232,.18);border-radius:10px;padding:.55rem .55rem .55rem 1.25rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.75rem;max-width:540px;margin-bottom:1.75rem;cursor:pointer" onclick="openIdx()"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(244,239,232,.4)" stroke-width="2" style="flex-shrink:0"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg><span style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.4);font-size:.95rem;flex:1">Search homes for sale in Myrtle Beach...</span><span style="background:rgba(196,120,58,.2);color:var(--brass-2);font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:.5rem .85rem;border-radius:6px;white-space:nowrap">Coming soon</span></div>
