+<li><a href="mailto:rboyd@cityofmyrtlebeach.com" target="_blank">Ryan Boyd</a>, Zoning Compliance Officer, <em>843-918-1182</em> &ndash; Code Compliance</li>
+<li><a href="mailto:dbyrd@cityofmyrtlebeach.com" target="_blank">Darius Byrd</a>, Zoning Compliance Officer, <em>843-918-2019</em> &ndash; Code Compliance</li>
