charge","title":"Community Probation Surcharge","description":"The probation surcharge amount, in whole dollars, is calculated by the company to rate the policy.\nNOTE: A probation surcharge is a flat surcharge that the policyholder must pay on each new or renewed policy issued covering property in a community that the NFIP has placed on probation under the provisions of 44 CFR 59.24","type":"smallint","sortOrder":44,"isSearchable":true,"isNestedObject":false,"isNullable":true,"primaryKey":false,"id":"169dc6f1-c9bf-4021-931f-a82e909288fd","lastRefresh":"2026-07-21T03:00:15.883Z","hash":"374e6005fee59a49b2796b4f5e1daa54c5481e28","srid":null},{"datasetId":"openfema-96","openFemaDataSet":"NfipPolicies","datasetVersion":3,"name":"premiumPaymentIndicator","title":"Premium Payment Indicator","description":"The payment mechanism used to purchase a flood insurance policy.\nLegal values (value : description):\n1: Credit or debit card;\n2: Cash or check;","type":"smallint","sortOrder":45,"isSearchable":true,"isNestedObject":false,"isNullable":true,"primaryKey":false,"id":"187fd309-aefa-4131-831c-644db0bba3a2","lastRefresh":"2026-07-21T03:00:15.883Z","hash":"a64e1288e294c82159f82f78575b309c295711f1","srid":null},{"datasetId":"openfema-96","openFemaDataSet":"NfipPolicies","datasetVersion":3,"name":"buildingReplacementCost","title":"Building Replacement Cost","description":"Estimated cost in whole dollars to replace the building as reported by the insurer. \nNOTE: Replacement cost is not market value, and it does not include the cost of the land or contents. It is strictly the estimated cost to reconstruct the building","type":"bigint","sortOrder":46,"isSearchable":true,"isNestedObject":false,"isNullable":true,"primaryKey":false,"id":"4a7ed8e0-f7bb-4754-988b-23f13ac40ff2","lastRefresh":"2026-07-21T03:00:15.883Z","hash":"368a5372a1e00693aabd01f6d5b6ba801da69497","srid":null},{"datasetId":"openfema-96","openFemaDataSet":"NfipPolicies","datasetVersion":3,"name":"basicBuildingRate",