ing the ratio of building insurance coverage purchased to the replacement cost value of the building\nLegal values (value : description):\n1 : Less than .50;\n2 : .50 - .74;\n3 : .75 or More;\nNOTE: This data element is required for l98l Post-FIRM Zones V, V1-V30, and VE ratings","type":"smallint","sortOrder":53,"isSearchable":true,"isNestedObject":false,"isNullable":true,"primaryKey":false,"id":"e0c51ff4-1cd3-40e8-9ccc-899404fd87c7","lastRefresh":"2026-07-21T03:00:15.883Z","hash":"a8ebd0a0ae8e6f22dfe40a62ed1cfa4f7555992e","srid":null},{"datasetId":"openfema-96","openFemaDataSet":"NfipPolicies","datasetVersion":3,"name":"postFirmVzoneIndicator","title":"Post-FIRM V Zone Indicator","description":"This indicates, for 1981 Post-FIRM Zone V rating, whether certification has been provided in accordance with Section 60.3(e) (4) of the Federal floodplain management regulations. Yes is indicated with either a 'true' or '1'. No is indicated with either a 'false' or '0'.","type":"boolean","sortOrder":54,"isSearchable":true,"isNestedObject":false,"isNullable":true,"primaryKey":false,"id":"fcf245e9-ad59-456e-a629-6c4ce8e52314","lastRefresh":"2026-07-21T03:00:15.883Z","hash":"4173af6e50e0c62ac59a63d9a6c7c2a5c14c8158","srid":null},{"datasetId":"openfema-96","openFemaDataSet":"NfipPolicies","datasetVersion":3,"name":"floodproofedIndicator","title":"Floodproofed Indicator","description":"Indicates if the insured structure is floodproofed. Yes is indicated with either a 'true' or '1'. No is indicated with either a 'false' or '0'.\nNOTE: Floodproofing is any combination of structural and non-structural additions, changes, or adjustments to structures which reduce or eliminate flood damage to a property. Floodproofing may be an alternative to elevating a building to or above the BFE; however, the NFIP requires a Floodproofing Certificate prior to considering floodproofing mitigation measures in rating a structure","type":"boolean","sortOrder":55,"isSearchable":false,"isNestedObject":f