+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-2660.</span> Listing of license registration applications to be furnished to county auditors.<br /><br />
+	The Department of Motor Vehicles shall furnish to the auditor of each county a listing of license registration applications to be mailed to the owners of motor vehicles in the respective counties. The listings must be furnished to the auditor as soon as possible but not later than sixty days before the expiration of the registration. Listings must be in the form of electronic media. The Department of Motor Vehicles shall provide notice to the respective counties each month for all vehicles that are licensed the second year of the two-year licensing period. This listing must contain an updating of the prior year&#39;s list to denote vehicles in which the license or registration is transferred or canceled.<br /><br />
