+	(iii) mortgages on real property; and<br /><br />
+	(iv) inventory.<br /><br />
+	(c) &quot;Real property construction or improvement financing agreement&quot; means an agreement to make cash disbursements to finance:<br /><br />
+	(i) the construction or improvement of real property;<br /><br />
+	(ii) a contract to construct or improve real property; or<br /><br />
